      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "いいじゃねえか。\r\n一度は戦った仲だしよ。\r\n目的が同じなら、向かう方向も一緒だろ？",
        "official_en": "Why not? We’ve already bumped our heads together as combat buddies. Besides, by the looks of it we’re headin’ in the same direction, anyhow.",
        "real_en": "What's wrong with that? We've fought each other once already. If we're after the same thing, we're headed the same way, right?"
      },
      "review": {
        "status": "CHANGE"
      },
